WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.012
Module 3 turns to the governor itself.

2
00:00:03.012 --> 00:00:08.038
If we credit SD-WAN with providing controls,
we owe the controls that protect it.

3
00:00:08.038 --> 00:00:11.467
We'll walk its attack surface,
make step zero checkable,

4
00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:15.659
look ahead to the governed path, pin
down the evidence it has to emit,

5
00:00:15.659 --> 00:00:19.820
and end with what the fabric owes
the applications that ride on it.
